  "description": "Handle database errors easily when working with Entity Framework Core. Catch specific exceptions such as UniqueConstraintException, CannotInsertNullException, MaxLengthExceededException, NumericOverflowException or ReferenceConstraintException instead of generic DbUpdateException\n\nUse this package with EF Core providers built on MySqlConnector, such as Pomelo.EntityFrameworkCore.MySql and its forks (for example Microting.EntityFrameworkCore.MySql)",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
  "id": "EntityFrameworkCore.Exceptions.MySqlConnector",
