  "published": "2026-11-20T20:51:56.84Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Update to .NET 11 and Entity Framework Core 11\n- Add UseExceptionProcessor overload that accepts a custom IDbExceptionClassifier\n- Populate ConstraintName and ConstraintProperties for alternate key violations\n- Fix constraint details when one constraint name contains another (for example IX_Users and IX_Users_Name): the longest matching name is now used\n- Add EntityFrameworkCore.Exceptions.MySqlConnector for EF Core providers built on MySqlConnector, such as Pomelo.EntityFrameworkCore.MySql and Microting.EntityFrameworkCore.MySql. It replaces EntityFrameworkCore.Exceptions.MySQL.Pomelo, which is discontinued",
